              <span class="text-slate-400 font-medium">报名链接：</span>
              <a href="https://luma.com/72p758yx" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-blue-400 hover:underline font-mono break-all">https://luma.com/72p758yx</a>
            </div>
            <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-2">
