              <span class="text-sm font-bold text-blue-400">议程二 · 技术实践</span>
              <span class="text-xs px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-blue-500/10 text-blue-300 border border-blue-500/20">约 30 分钟</span>
            </div>
            <h4 class="text-lg font-bold text-white">2. Michael HUO 霍明旭：个人智能体（Personal Agent）现状与实践</h4>
            <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm md:text-base text-slate-200 pl-1">
              <li>• Meta Muse、ChatGPT Dot、Claude Duet、Google Gemini、Grok Bot 对比</li>
              <li>• 自托管方案：OpenClaw、Hermes</li>
              <li>• 安全、隐私与合规注意事项</li>
              <li>• StackChan 桌面机器人演示：具身智能与物理 AI 结合</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Speaker Bios -->
        <div class="p-6 md:p-8 bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-800 rounded-3xl space-y-5">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white border-l-4 border-emerald-500 pl-3">🎙️ 嘉宾介绍</h3>

          <div class="space-y-4">
            <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-slate-950/50 border border-slate-800/90 space-y-1.5">
